eave** — he is left behind. The woman walks away.\n\n- The **only valid criteria met** in this sequence are:\n  - woman and man meeting together (Frames 4–7)\n  - man staring at woman (Frames 11–15)\n  - woman walking away (Frame 13)\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nAnswer choice **'2'** — which implies **“the woman goes to a beach”** — is **not supported** by any visual evidence in the frames. The setting is clearly an urban park or café patio with cherry blossoms, not a beach.\n\n✅ Therefore, **the answer '2' is incorrect**.\n\nThe correct summary would involve the couple meeting, the woman walking away, and the man being left behind — possibly matching an answer choice like “the man is left behind after the woman walks away” — but **not** “the woman goes to a beach.”"}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 42, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0414.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0415.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0416.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0417.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0418.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0419.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0420.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0421.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0422.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0423.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0424.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/q01CUy_gwdU/frames/frame_0425.jpg'], 'response': "Based on the provided frames (0414–0425) and the question criteria, **the answer '2' is NOT correct**.\n\n### Here’s why:\n\nThe question asks:  \n> *What best summarizes the first half of the events when the woman and the man meet for the t